# No global `*` owner. The `main-ruleset` requires code-owner review, so a
# catch-all here made every PR wait on the maintainer — including Renovate's
# dev-tooling group, which renovate.json marks automerge and which could then
# never merge. Ownership is listed per path instead: package.json and
# package-lock.json are deliberately absent, and Renovate's own automerge
# setting decides which dependency PRs still need a human.

# The security claim itself. These files are the product; a change to any of
# them is a change to what the app promises.
/manifest.yml @edlopez000
/test/manifest.test.js @edlopez000
/SECURITY.md @edlopez000

# Shipped code, and the pipeline that tests and deploys it.
/src/ @edlopez000
/static/ @edlopez000
/.github/ @edlopez000
/renovate.json @edlopez000
